  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2016/05/IMG_7385.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: Arial; font-size: 14.6667px; line-height: 21.3333px;\">(272 fotos) A mediod&iacute;a de este s&aacute;bado se han clausurado en el campo municipal de La Serratella los XXXIII Juegos Escolares Deportivos de Onda, que organizan el Ayuntamiento, la Caja Rural y las asociaciones de madres y padres de alumnos (AMPA). Han presidido el acto el alcalde, Ximo Huguet Lecha, y el presidente de la cooperativa de cr&eacute;dito, Salvador Calzada Feliu.</span></p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/cloendajocsesportiusescolarsonda16/img_7102.jpg\" alt=\"img_7102\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/cloendajocsesportiusescolarsonda16/img_7103.jpg\" alt=\"img_7103\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/cloendajocsesportiusescolarsonda16/img_7105.jpg\" alt=\"img_7105\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/cloendajocsesportiusescolarsonda16/img_7106.jpg\" alt=\"img_7106\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/cloendajocsesportiusescolarsonda16/img_7107.jpg\" alt=\"img_7107\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/cloendajocsesportiusescolarsonda16/img_7108.jpg\" alt=\"img_7108\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/cloendajocsesportiusescolarsonda16/img_7109.jpg\" alt=\"img_7109\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439e